    <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Part I Sales or Exchange of Property Used in a Trade or Business and Inventory Conversions From Other Than Casualty or Theft Property Held More Than 1 Year</p>
    </div>
  </div>

