        <th style="width: 10%;"> (b) Date acquired</th>
        <th style="width: 10%;"> (c) Date sold</th>
        <th style="width: 10%;"> (d) Sales price</th>
        <th style="width: 10%;"> (e) Adjusted basis</th>
        <th style="width: 10%;"> (f) Gain or loss</th>
        <th style="width: 10%;"> (g) LOBS (if applicable)</th>
        <th style="width: 10%;"> (h) From Form 4797, line {{ line_number_h }}</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in sales_data %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="sales_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].description">{{ item.description }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="sales_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].date_acquired">{{ item.date_acquired }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="sales_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].date_sold">{{ item.date_sold }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="sales_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].sales_price">{{ item.sales_price }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="sales_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].adjusted_basis">{{ item.adjusted_basis }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="sales_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].gain_loss">{{ item.gain_loss }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="sales_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].lobs">{{ item.lobs }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="sales_data[{{ loop.index0 }}].from_form_4797_h">{{ item.from_form_4797_h }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Part II Ordinary Gains and Losses</p>
  </div>

  <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 10%;"></th>
        <th style="width: 10%;"></th>
        <th style="width: 10%;"></th>
        <th style="width: 10%;"></th>
        <th style="width: 10%;"></th>
        <th style="width: 10%;"></th>
        <th style="width: 10%;"></th>
        <th style="width: 10%;"></th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">11. Ordinary gains and losses not included on lines 12 through 18 (include property held 1 year or less):</td>
        <td colspan="7"></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Part III At-Risk Limits</p>
  </div>

  <table style="margin-top: 10px;">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 10%;"></th>
        <th style="width: 10%;"></th>
        <th style="width: 10%;"></th>
        <th style="width: 10%;"></th>
        <th style="width: 10%;"></th>
        <th style="width: 10%;"></th>
        <th style="width: 10%;"></th>
        <th style="width: 10%;"></th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">12. Loss, if any, from line 8.</td>
        <td colspan="7"></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">13. Gain, if any, from line 6, or amount from line 9 if applicable.</td>
        <td colspan="7"></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">14. Gain, if any, from line 35.</td>
        <td colspan="7"></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">15. Net gain or (loss) from Form 4684, lines 31 and 36.</td>
        <td colspan="7"></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">16. Ordinary gain from installment sales from Form 6252, line 25 or 36.</td>
        <td colspan="7"></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">17. Ordinary gain or loss from land exchanges from Form 8624.</td>
        <td colspan="7"></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">18. Reapture of section 179 expenses deduction for partners and S corporation shareholders from property dispositions by partnerships and S corporations (see instructions).</td>
        <td colspan="7"></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">19. Add lines 11 through 18 in columns (g) and (h).</td>
        <td colspan="7"></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">20. Combine columns (g) and (h) of line 19. Enter gain or (loss) here, and on the appropriate line as follows:</td>
        <td colspan="7"></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">a. For all except individual returns: Enter the gain or (loss) from line 20 on the return being filed.</td>
        <td colspan="7"></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;">b. For individual returns:</td>
        <td colspan="7"></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 10%;"> (1) If the loss on line 12 includes a loss from Form 4684, line 35, column (d), enter that part of the loss here and on line 22 of Schedule A (Form 1040), identified as "From Form 4797, line 20(b)". See instructions.</td>
        <td colspan="7"></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Page 17</p>
  </div>
